{"id": 10005697, "reference": "A12/00397/22", "publication_date": "2022-03-09T16:21:12.419Z", "modification_date": "2022-03-09T16:21:12.420Z", "country": "Norway", "product_category": "ELECTRICAL_APPLIANCES", "product_name": "Loudspeaker", "product_name_specific": "Waterproof wireless speaker", "risk_description": "The solder contains an excessive amount of cadmium and lead (measured values up to 4% and 0.06% by weight respectively). \nLead and cadmium pose a risk to the environment. \nFurthermore, the charging cable and the suction cap contain short chain chlorinated paraffins (SCCP) (measured values up to 6.7% and 4.8% by weight, respectively). The SCCPs persist in the environment, are toxic to aquatic organisms at low concentrations and bioaccumulate in wildlife and humans, posing a risk to human health and the environment. The charging cable contains also an excessive amount of bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP) and dibutyl phthalate (DBP) (measured values 1.17% and 0.7% by weight, respectively). The phthalates DEHP and DBP may harm the health of children, causing possible damage to their reproductive system.", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the requirements of the Directive on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (RoHS 2 Directive), the Persistent Organic Pollutants (POPs) Regulation nor the REACH Regulation.\n", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["X-1"], "model_types": [], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL", "ENVIRONMENT"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_WITHDRAWAL_FROM_MARKET", "PRODUCT_WITHDRAWAL_FROM_MARKET"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10049182, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10049180, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10049181, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10049183, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id":